        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86403, Crystal Lido Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Lido Clear Crystal Cabinet Knob is made from clear crystal. You can choose your favorite color of mount finish for a truly custom look. The Crystal Lido Cabinet Knob is available in 2 sizes. Each kitchen cabinet knob comes packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Lido Cabinet Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Crystal with Brass Rosette</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86403-specifications.pdf?v=1704262413\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Lido Cabinet Knob Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>Small:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Large:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Mount Finish Choices</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
