                "description": "The Lido Clear Crystal Cabinet Knob is made from clear crystal. You can choose your favorite color of mount finish for a truly custom look. The Crystal Lido Cabinet Knob is available in 2 sizes. Each kitchen cabinet knob comes packaged with mounting hardware.",
